{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/860368-chariot-funded-stretched-and-three-days-to-go","id":860368,"title":"CHARIOT - funded, stretched and three days to go","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-06T09:28:08-07:00","id":860368,"title":"CHARIOT - funded, stretched and three days to go","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jYCVUhcDsaw/Vrj-pGg8X0I/AAAAAAAAAys/1V3zBp0gfV4/s780/new%2Blogo%2Btraced%2Biso.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>OK, with about 72 hours to go, <b>CHARIOT</b>, my one-man-show, home-made, autobiographical labour of love has hit the first of its two stretch goals, namely the Supporting Cast Catalogue, as written by the most excellent <b>Malcolm Sheppard</b>, which will be released to everyone who backs the game.<br /> <br /> If I somehow make another grand (hey, stranger things have happened), the equally awesome <b>Stew Wilson </b>is on hand to supply some deep world background on science, magic and history.<br /> <br /> Aside from Malcolm's sections, the game is already complete as written, and all backers, no matter how small their contribution, receive all drafts of the game.<br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-z7XFzrU7pyQ/VwUk1K1sIFI/AAAAAAAAA5s/EqvFgTAKnLUXukUM2fZhrUtI0CfMv20uQ/s400/major_1_magician.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><br /> In CHARIOT, you play one of the handful of primeval people, Atlanteans, Muvians, Lemurians, who learned that they were fated to die in the Final Catastrophe... <i>and not before</i>. With the knowledge that nothing you do will end in your demise before the final fall of Atlantis and faced for the first time with the sins of empire, what will you do to make a difference in the final days? <br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-vv_t-qbuZ64/Vv-UvFBOgFI/AAAAAAAAA5A/agaWxkNhU0kdHN18KUEkqZy5FF15DbzNA/s640/major_20_judgement.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><br /> The baroque, heavily atmospheric setting of CHARIOT is flavoured heavily with a lifetime's research in the Atlantis of theosophists, occultists and outsiders, and its simple, intuitive mechanics, which use a deck of Tarot cards, give the game a strong occult flavour, incentivise human relationships and reward caring. A Catastrophe List gives you the tools to give your games an ever-increasing sense of urgency as Atlantis falls into chaos and doom.<br /> <br /> Endings, Catastrophe, Victory: Death, the Tower and the Chariot. What will be your fate? <b>Where will you stand, in the face of the coming wave?</b><br /> <br /> Check out Chariot's developmental blog (<a href=\"http://chariotrpg.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://chariotrpg.blogspot.com</a> ) with extracts, fiction and writings on the history of Atlantis in the occult.<br /> <br /> And please, if you can't support Chariot, please consider sharing and publicising this. I've done this wholly on my own over the last year and I think it's the best game thing I've ever written.<br /> <br /> Support Chariot on IndieGoGo at <a href=\"http://igg.me/at/ChariotRoleplay\" target=\"_blank\">http://igg.me/at/ChariotRoleplay</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4413-frances-best-friend","name":"Frances' Best Friend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T08:18:21-07:00","id":861060,"title":"","content":"This... this looks awesome.<br /> I'm binging on your blog right now. I'll support this as soon as I get home.<br /> <br /> Hell... I'm sending you a pm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}